<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-WEST INDIES 29 FOR ONE AT CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES 29 FOR ONE AT CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies, chasing Australia's first innings of 219 all out, were 29 for one at the close of play on the first day of the third test at the Melbourne Cricket Ground on Thursday.</p>
<p>Scores - Australia 219 all out in 74.5 overs (Greg Blewett 62, Steve Waugh 58, Curtly Ambrose five for 55); West Indies 29 for one.</p>
